    <mxCell id="step-1-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Collect evidence&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;Inspectors run on the Beacon host. Live CLIs or fixtures. A live failure is sealed as live_failed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-1-legend">
